ifc:IfcBorehole a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Borehole" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ifc:IfcGeotechnicalAssembly ;
    skos:definition "Representation of the concept of a linear geological and geotechnical model, usually an interpretation but sometimes created direct from ground penetrating measurement; The assembly may contain one of more strata and other elements such as capping and lining. The contained subtypes of [[IfcGeotechnicalStratum]] will have shape representations made from straight or bent tubes reflecting the bore diameter, or discs if a 'Yabuki' top surface model is being used." ;
