ifc:IfcEvaporativeCoolerINDIRECTEVAPORATIVEWETCOIL a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Indirect Evaporative Wet Coil" ;
    rdfs:comment "Technical note: Because this class is a 'Predefined Type' in IFC, meaning a specialisation of its parent class, in IFC it should be represented by the parent class." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ifc:IfcEvaporativeCooler ;
    skos:definition "Cools the air stream by evaporating water indirectly and without adding moisture into the air stream. [[Water]] is sprayed directly on the tubes of the heat exchanger where latent cooling takes place and the vaporization of the water on the outside of the heat exchanger tubes allows the simultaneous heat and mass transfer which removes heat from the supply air on the tube side." ;
