ifc:IfcMobileTelecommunicationsApplianceE_UTRAN_NODE_B a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "E Utran Node B" ;
    rdfs:comment "Technical note: Because this class is a 'Predefined Type' in IFC, meaning a specialisation of its parent class, in IFC it should be represented by the parent class." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ifc:IfcMobileTelecommunicationsAppliance ;
    skos:definition "An E-utran nodel B is a logical network component which serves one or more E-utran cells. It is the hardware connected to the evolved packet core (EPC), more specifically to the mobility management entity (MME) , which communicates directly with user equipment in wireless way." ;
