ifc:IfcMobileTelecommunicationsApplianceMOBILESWITCHIN a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Mobile Switching Center" ;
    rdfs:comment "Technical note: Because this class is a 'Predefined Type' in IFC, meaning a specialisation of its parent class, in IFC it should be represented by the parent class." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ifc:IfcMobileTelecommunicationsAppliance ;
    skos:definition "The mobile switching centre (MSC) constitutes the interface between the radio system and the fixed networks. It is an exchange which performs all the switching and signalling functions for mobile station located in a geographical area designated as the MSC area. It consists of a MSC server and a media gateway." ;
