ifc:IfcProtectiveDeviceEARTHLEAKAGECIRCUITBREAKER a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Earth Leakage Circuit Breaker" ;
    rdfs:comment "Technical note: Because this class is a 'Predefined Type' in IFC, meaning a specialisation of its parent class, in IFC it should be represented by the parent class." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ifc:IfcProtectiveDevice ;
    skos:definition "A device that opens, closes, or isolates a circuit and has short circuit protection but no overload protection. It attempts to break the circuit when there is a leakage of current from phase to earth, by measuring voltage on the earth conductor." ;
