    skos:definition "Label to indicate the material or construction of the molding around the space ceiling. The label is used for room book information.The material information is provided in absence of an [[IfcCovering]] (type=MOLDING) object with own shape representation and material assignment. In case of inconsistency the material assigned to [[IfcCovering]] elements takes precedence." ;
