    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    skos:definition "[[Height]] of the molding.The height information is provided in absence of an [[IfcCovering]] (type=MOLDING) object with own shape representation and material assignment. In case of inconsistency the height assigned to [[IfcCovering]] elements takes precedence." ;
