    rdfs:comment "Technical note: in IFC this property takes 'IfcDuration' as value. Such objects are not included in bSDD for simplicity reason. IFC also doesn't enforce particular units, but recommends using metric SI units (metre, kilogram, etc.). Read the IFC documentation for more information." ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "The elapsed time within a worktime-based month. For presentation purposes, applications may choose to display [[IfcTask]] durations in work months where IfcTaskTime.DurationType=WORKTIME. This value must be less than or equal to 744 hours (an elapsed month of 31 days); if omitted then 160 hours is assumed." ;
    meta:propertyValueKind "Single" ;
    meta:sourceCode "WorkMonthDuration" .

ifc:WorkStartTime a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Work Start Time" ;
    rdfs:comment "Technical note: in IFC this property takes 'IfcTime' as value. Such objects are not included in bSDD for simplicity reason. IFC also doesn't enforce particular units, but recommends using metric SI units (metre, kilogram, etc.). Read the IFC documentation for more information." ;
