ifc:IfcFeatureElementSubtraction a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Feature Element Subtraction" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ifc:IfcFeatureElement ;
    skos:definition "The [[IfcFeatureElementSubtraction]] is specialization of the general feature element, that represents an existence dependent element which modifies the shape and appearance of the associated master element. The [[IfcFeatureElementSubtraction]] offers the ability to handle shape modifiers as semantic objects within the IFC object model that subtract from the shape of the master element." ;
