ifc:IfcBuildingElementPart a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Building Element Part" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ifc:IfcElementComponent ;
    skos:definition "[[IfcBuildingElementPart]] represents major components as subordinate parts of a building element. Typical usage examples include precast concrete sandwich walls, where the layers may have different geometry representations. In this case the layered material representation does not sufficiently describe the element. Each layer is represented by an own instance of the [[IfcBuildingElementPart]] with its own geometry description." ;
